# NursingHome — solution-local ignore rules.
#
# The repository-root .gitignore already excludes .env*, docker-compose*.yml,
# secrets, and certs. The negations below re-include the files that are SAFE and
# meant to be committed (they contain no secrets), while keeping the real secret
# and local-override files ignored.

# --- Keep ignored (belt-and-suspenders; also covered by the root .gitignore) --
.env
.env.local
appsettings.Local.json
docker-compose.override.yml
#documentation file
documentations/

# --- Re-include committed, secret-free templates/infra ------------------------
!.env.example
!docker-compose.yml
